{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b9f57897a8982055c7cd8858857fcd2a3ace0fb7aefa631ac728b09cc11f11ba", "ja": "新生『I.V.』発表", "zh": "新生『I.V.』发表", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea192400397b8ece0fefaee3982dbb885f685e0c9fdd9043a056d19be0ca9f91", "ja": "新生『I.V.』に選ばれた真珠星、藍、\nなる、クロエはデビュー記者会見で\nそれぞれの意気込みや思いを語る。そんな中\n真珠星は自分だけが後ろ盾や実績のない\n一般人であることを実感してしまう。", "zh": "被选入新生《I.V.》的真珠星、藍、なる和クロエ在出道记者会上分别谈起了自己的决心与想法。然而，真珠星意识到，只有自己是没有靠山和实绩的普通人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6849e3c52f1fd3aa44e0db649f1e7105a288b701cb233e07862bc770534f1b74", "ja": "（第三幕。オーディションの結果、新生I.V.の\nメンバーが決まった。新体制は、4人）", "zh": "（第三幕。试镜结果揭晓，新生『I.V.』的成员已经确定。新体制共有4人）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "c6611d9e2914835f83ab6b8a732167b44c83a054e8160f3c9fafe21f902a0b94", "ja": "（なるとクロエの『Vermilion Red』。\nそして藍と真珠星の『Indigo Blue』だ）", "zh": "（鸣斗和克洛伊的《Vermilion Red》。然后是蓝和真珠星的《Indigo Blue》。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "7d66ff8dfca0d8db9c56e7a7d0857be692db2af77a0a3934fd7daa9764512e3b", "ja": "私たち4人は、新生『I.V.』として正式にデビュー。\n発表記者会見が、大々的に行われた。", "zh": "我们4人，以新生『I.V.』的身份正式出道。\n发布记者会见，也以盛大的规模举行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1001_mc", "source_sha256": "87c29df082dd9414a78c8aff9631f274b19a0c9ea6aaaf73180129b224ce2886", "ja": "『I.V.』のみなさん、\n自己紹介ありがとうございました。", "zh": "『I.V.』的各位，\n非常感谢大家的自我介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1002_mc", "source_sha256": "ea846f32137ba48c08d14247efc6c9d7849020fd4709d5987015fe4f8825828e", "ja": "それでは、以降は質疑応答の時間となります。\n質問のある記者の方は……。", "zh": "那么，接下来进入问答环节。\n有问题的记者请……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1003_kisyatati", "source_sha256": "6f7cb5e80fb3da3d0e814f41f0b64d180af4a0187e852de89fe01c6f5553d5a2", "ja": "「「「「はい！！！！」」」」", "zh": "「「「「是！！！！」」」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "f43ddfd3f81201cabfbf2da24a7fb4bf37baafa490f70fd6eb653bbf9f210dfb", "ja": "うっ！？", "zh": "唔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1005_kisyaa", "source_sha256": "13bed84391176e2af046732964c328bf9ad5a6cd401a4fab965c90ad04d76851", "ja": "新生『I.V.』として生まれ変わったという事ですが、\nメンバーに『一宮』のお名前がありますね。", "zh": "听说是作为全新的『I.V.』重获新生了，不过，成员中有一位名叫『一宫』呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1006_kisyaa", "source_sha256": "71c52b9c7fc049a8550b1ad80db74f14a699d636320701e48041955a83e0ff2c", "ja": "当方の事前取材では、前メンバーである\n一宮織姫さんの、妹さんとうかがっておりますが！", "zh": "根据我方的事前采访，听说您是前成员\n一宫织姬小姐的妹妹，请问属实吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "410814145409b6f924daf711870670044357e0c4fd523d23da5eb109e8017a5d", "ja": "そうですね。\n真珠星は、織姫の妹です。", "zh": "是的。\n珍珠星是织姬的妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1008_kisyatati", "source_sha256": "e799956c210da46dbd950676b77e99e10d09cc26e9ed46c2ba633507b54ad1d3", "ja": "ザワッ……！", "zh": "一阵骚动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1009_kisyab", "source_sha256": "d06deb1eba053fbcb99f6178189d420abf2ebb1e61cb01651f1225e9f7763835", "ja": "という事は、やはりお姉さんの遺志を継ごうと\nアイドル活動を始められたんですか！？", "zh": "也就是说，您果然是为了继承姐姐的遗志，才开始偶像活动的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "9c4f4e58ec1e7d0ea162b05d076c3aca73d89d39d5828144b4021f194fa885e4", "ja": "え？\nいや、別に、お姉ちゃんは関係な……。", "zh": "诶？\n不是，其实和姐姐没什……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1011_se", "source_sha256": "1caed777cb39a80afba779e36eaa6ab6d2e53ce499b30af8407214a4897d0c07", "ja": "ギュッ", "zh": "紧紧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "bad605892b788d7f5e6347251904237150d3b7a28f8a0d960926d26d419ffe09", "ja": "イダッ！？\n……ちょっと！　何すんの！？", "zh": "好痛！？\n……喂！你干什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "249fd73a80ca85a40cb9d83b8eb3d9812a8514c9b67830cb6b3a9c95dbc0a458", "ja": "真珠星、記者さんがお待ちかねよ？\n迅速かつ適切な回答をしなくちゃ、……ね？", "zh": "珍珠星，记者还等着你呢？  \n得迅速而恰当地回答才行……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "f909a65e73241c428c8e03c48e9d4309a3e2ae7d93b70ab849765aa1e362c3d1", "ja": "……あ、姉の事は尊敬していますが、違う人間なので。\n姉の代わりなんて、とても……。", "zh": "……虽、虽然我很尊敬姐姐，但毕竟我们是不同的人。\n要代替姐姐什么的，实在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "dd7a8b4581d51389120009e1551bdbeb8d81b87520e7b2aef14b432221a4d732", "ja": "最初こそ、織姫に関する事が多かったものの。\n質問は次第に、他のメンバーへと向けられていった。", "zh": "虽然一开始大多是关于织姬的问题，但渐渐地，话题也转向了其他成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1016_kisyaa", "source_sha256": "c4fb20ef58d9e442ab770383b7f0a5fddb2c2e6ce72e3b29c58351adb31b17ec", "ja": "大物俳優、三船新一郎を父に持つ三船なるさんですが\n……俳優ではなく、アイドルを選んだ理由は？", "zh": "父亲是大牌演员三船新一郎的三船鸣小姐，\n请问您没有成为演员，而是选择做偶像的理由是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "bcd3f3d012a89ef89db312165bc55713d111fe2db20119d3c12b6c1c5954e3f3", "ja": "あの……えっと、アイドルは私の憧れで……。\nだから、が、頑張りたいと思います！", "zh": "那个……呃，偶像一直是我憧憬的目标……\n所以，我、我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1018_kisyab", "source_sha256": "cef60908c6986bf8e495c5b35b456ee2a12819a70b5dab8c7d8f0833eaf448ea", "ja": "暁クロエさん！　SNSから、いよいよ日本の\n芸能界に舞台を移されるそうですが、目標は！？", "zh": "暁克洛伊小姐！听说您即将从社交媒体转战日本演艺圈，您的目标是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "9bd47ec9d267c71e7711399149abe70e2fda354ce79a022fdee02b476a5fdf08", "ja": "目標……？\n別に……トップ以外、興味ないです。", "zh": "目标……？\n没什么……除了登顶以外，我没兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1020_kisyac", "source_sha256": "93d6cff0a6e414b82fa47e6a609bbad1c730a133a138531442d24f730cec8f62", "ja": "最後に、笹森藍さん！　オリジナルメンバーとして、\n新しい『I.V.』への意気込みをお願いします！", "zh": "最后，请问笹森藍小姐！作为原始成员，\n请谈谈您对新『I.V.』的期待与抱负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "464a3847e1ff656a07fc5f696b74895d44ee13a23d1e96856dc80518fd0033a4", "ja": "はい。このメンバーで新生『I.V.』が始動しますが\n……語る言葉が必要だとは、あまり感じていません。", "zh": "是的，新生的『I.V.』将由这群成员正式启动，不过……我不太觉得有必要多说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "4fc339ccead3814614fca4e9591612ec52579f047d2ec149985cd9ddaed2b7db", "ja": "『I.V.』の名に恥じない活動を約束します。\n期待していてください。", "zh": "我保证我们的活动绝不会辱没“I.V.”之名。\n敬请期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e1e6dce99a65ac19664fee869a8ae5249e3a9236b4f65d28acb0f973b496976", "ja": "（……。\nわかってたことだけど……）", "zh": "（……。虽然这是早就知道的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "72d1fc832d5314216365fd5cc43050a145897c5c08bdd2fdfed5fd75e57437c6", "ja": "（私だけ、一般人……なんだなぁ……）", "zh": "（只有我，是普通人……啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1025_null", "source_sha256": "a7f5331a79549d81514da204d548b27a6692393f2961b6edc48d32d6f41e114a", "ja": "記者会見終了後……", "zh": "记者会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "f4941e9619256d1094066d9b62cd0671611307793c2e576f3b2985663d3364f8", "ja": "ひとまずお疲れさま。\n改めて、新生『I.V.』始動よ。", "zh": "总之，辛苦了。\n重新开始，新生的《I.V.》正式启动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "9fcbd3f8505b9f644f3862dcceabda50b9ad36b2b5cb84233ffbbc49f4c29df3", "ja": "明日から早速仕事が入って……\n？　真珠星、なんかテンション低いけど？", "zh": "明天开始就马上有工作安排了……  \n咦？真珠星，你好像没什么精神啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "30c431556bcd3ad96c9617e6f1fc6152fb443982d29e6a7e233ca27616f70922", "ja": "……。なんか、みんなみたいにバシッとしたこと\n言えなかったから……。", "zh": "……。总觉得，没能像大家那样\n说出帅气得体的话来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "b51953062a08e0312dea55f6cb914352635e70f1c544c846de6f9c4f835a1864", "ja": "そもそも、記者会見なんて初めてだし！\n一般人の私に不利すぎるっていうか！", "zh": "说到底，我还是第一次参加记者会嘛！\n对普通人的我来说，实在太不利了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "e1b24f32497413a4a0aaef5fc3650820741b088690e6990e5c442a3c76fb90df", "ja": "仕方ないでしょ。\nあなた、本当に一般人なんだし。", "zh": "没办法吧。你本来就是普通人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_01_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "00c6d26ae916e86f92d23c329350552bb27d03bc0e47161cbcec13879582d407", "ja": "芸能界っていう違う世界に飛び込んだんだから。\nそこは、最初に自覚しておかないとね。", "zh": "因为你是闯入了演艺圈这个不同世界的人嘛。\n这一点，得从一开始就有所自觉才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
